/series/dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDIyL0Jvc2NoJTIwTGVnYWN5JTIwJTI4MjAyMiUyOS8"}],"videos":[{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMjAyMy9TaGFpdGFuJTIwJTI4MjAyMyUyOS8.1.1","title":"In the Lap of Death","season":1,"episode":1,"released":"2023-06-15T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"The Home Minister orders to hunt down Baali after he threatens him. Back in the past, a cop sexually exploits Baali's mother, Savitri. But what happens when he eyes Baali’s sister?","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/yppwYxAtvlDIu5FD6CtScyPP5Fa.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMjAyMy9TaGFpdGFuJTIwJTI4MjAyMyUyOS8.1.2","title":"Lal Salam","season":1,"episode":2,"released":"2023-06-15T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"To arrange money for his sister’s marriage, Baali agrees to work for a corrupt jeweller and ends up in trouble. While escaping the cops, he meets Kalavathi, a Naxal sympathiser.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/rqwYqgIF4zjM3GuczragN0lYSAG.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMjAyMy9TaGFpdGFuJTIwJTI4MjAyMyUyOS8.1.3","title":"Kingdom of Shaitans","season":1,"episode":3,"released":"2023-06-15T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"An ex-Naxal, Obuleshu, plans a murder inside the jail. Baali offers to do the job to impress Naxal leader Sambanna, who then appoints him to kill a new Greyhound officer, Vijay Kumar.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/1TJgPRchCo6MlKYzobQpHaGGNy8.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMjAyMy9TaGFpdGFuJTIwJTI4MjAyMyUyOS8.1.4","title":"Counter - Encounter","season":1,"episode":4,"released":"2023-06-15T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Baali, Kalavathi and Naxal leader Sujatha eliminate Vijay Kumar. His successor, Nagi Reddy, plans to avenge his death, which proves costly for the Naxals.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/q4qp1LeRjd59wXNskc3ZQeFr4iB.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMjAyMy9TaGFpdGFuJTIwJTI4MjAyMyUyOS8.1.5","title":"Proof of Death","season":1,"episode":5,"released":"2023-06-15T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"As Nagi Reddy continues to arrest Vijay Kumar’s killers, Baali surrenders. Ranganna does the unthinkable, beginning a vicious cycle of murder and revenge amongst the Naxals.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/osx5WPccNKGiDVVFVuNHdLsM47d.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMjAyMy9TaGFpdGFuJTIwJTI4MjAyMyUyOS8.1.6","title":"The Price of Revenge","season":1,"episode":6,"released":"2023-06-15T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Baali’s family takes an extreme step to wipe off any evidence of their crime. However, Nagi Reddy learns of Gumthi's involvement and makes an offer.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/dpn6lDvQwKw0054yvFMmV1FAF2X.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMjAyMy9TaGFpdGFuJTIwJTI4MjAyMyUyOS8.1.7","title":"Good + Bad vs Evil","season":1,"episode":7,"released":"2023-06-15T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"With a hidden agenda, Nagi Reddy forms an alliance with Baali, and they decide to destroy the Naxal network. But Baali faces yet another personal loss.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/hakoVUarYvCYRfD7pT3OZgJ4Qjc.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMjAyMy9TaGFpdGFuJTIwJTI4MjAyMyUyOS8.1.8","title":"Liberated by Death","season":1,"episode":8,"released":"2023-06-15T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Jayaprada seduces Obuleshu with an ulterior motive. Sambanna joins politics, and Nagi Reddy is ordered to kill Baali. This leads to a shocking revelation between Baali and Nagi Reddy.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/eta1lCErJYovsLQ6auJI49dm21I.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMjAyMy9TaGFpdGFuJTIwJTI4MjAyMyUyOS8.1.9","title":"The Birth of Shaitan","season":1,"episode":9,"released":"2023-06-15T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Baali flees after exacting his revenge in public. Learning about Nagi Reddy's involvement, the Home Minister orders his encounter. What happens when Baali knows about it?","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/qfsBzQe13MAQ987YVw7DmwR5Men.jpg"}]}}